00:49.055 --> 00:51.683
You gotta like
that he can add 10 and two.

00:51.858 --> 00:55.021
Yeah, and he did it in his head.

00:56.796 --> 00:59.924
- Hey, hey, concentrate on the road.
- You listen to the radio while you drive.

01:00.099 --> 01:02.795
