- You drive like an old woman.

01:03.002 --> 01:07.063
An experienced old woman. My point is,
never take your eyes off the road.

01:07.240 --> 01:10.573
Don't distract the kid. He can
barely crap and read at the same time.

01:10.743 --> 01:12.142
- I can too.
- Look at the road.

01:12.312 --> 01:14.007
Don't yell at him.
Jake, look out, look out!

01:16.549 --> 01:18.779
Will you guys just let me drive?

01:18.952 --> 01:21.716
Fine, fine. Drive.

01:23.957 --> 01:27.518
So, Charlie,
when's your fiancée back in town?

01:27.694 --> 01:29.889
Uh, next week.

01:30.096 --> 01:32.997
