02:38.498 --> 02:40.932
Can we please just sit down?

02:42.602 --> 02:45.400
No, no, slide over one, slide over one.
I need the aisle.

02:45.605 --> 02:47.334
Why do you always need the aisle?

02:47.907 --> 02:51.502
He's got a prostate the size of an apple
and has to pee every five minutes.

02:51.678 --> 02:55.512
There's nothing wrong with my prostate,
I've got a teeny bladder, it's genetic.

02:55.682 --> 02:57.377
Another reason I think you were adopted.

02:57.550 --> 03:00.917
Ha, ha. It wasn't funny when I was 6,
