What are you doing here?

17:15.073 --> 17:19.305
Okay, first of all, your uncle and I
would like to apologize...

17:19.478 --> 17:20.672
...for our behavior last week.

17:20.846 --> 17:23.974
Whoa, whoa, whoa.
I've got nothing to apologize for.

17:24.316 --> 17:26.784
So you've been perfect
through this whole thing?

17:26.952 --> 17:28.749
What can I tell you? I'm a hummingbird.

17:30.289 --> 17:33.588
- Shut up, Charlie.
- I hate you and you were adopted.

17:37.196 --> 17:38.663
Your uncle and I understand...

17:38.830 --> 17:40.991
...that we might have made you
uncomfortable.

17:41.166 --> 17:45.000
And we want you to know that we're
gonna make a real effort to change.

17:45.437 --> 17:47.962
When are you planning to start?

17:48.173 --> 17:50.437
- Right now. Right, Charlie?
- Yeah, sure.

17:50.609 --> 17:53.077
- So you guys will stop fighting so much?
- Yes.

17:53.278 --> 17:56.941
- And you won't embarrass me in public?
- When did we embarrass you in public?

17:57.115 --> 17:58.946
Come on, you embarrass him constantly.

17:59.117 --> 18:01.449
- And you don't?
- Hey, I'm the colorful uncle.

18:01.620 --> 18:04.453
One day, he'll be telling his kids
funny stories about me.

18:04.623 --> 18:08.889
- He'll be telling stories about me too.
- Yeah, to his court-appointed psychiatrist.

18:10.095 --> 18:13.292
- You have got a cruel streak that is ugly.
- Wanna know what's ugly?

18:13.465 --> 18:14.989
The schmuck who lives in my guestroom.

18:15.167 --> 18:20.195
Heh. At least I am not an aging pretty boy
clinging onto the last dregs of his youth.

18:20.372 --> 18:22.966
What are you saying,
I'm losing my looks?

18:23.976 --> 18:26.376
Oh, now you're worried.
Let me tell you something.

18:26.545 --> 18:27.978
Looks is all you've ever had.

18:28.146 --> 18:31.172
No heart, no soul,
no depth of character whatsoever.

18:31.350 --> 18:33.716
Come on, be honest.
Which would you rather have?

18:33.885 --> 18:36.376
My looks or those other three things?

18:36.555 --> 18:39.217
You know what? Bite me.

18:39.391 --> 18:41.985
I can't believe you actually bit me.

18:42.261 --> 18:45.059
Wait, wait.
I thought you were gonna talk to him.

18:45.230 --> 18:46.857
We did. He's still upset with us.

18:47.032 --> 18:49.592
You know teenagers,
you just can't reason with them.

18:49.768 --> 18:52.328
Oh, really? Wait right here.

18:54.072 --> 18:57.940
I don't give a damn. Weekends
are the only peace I get around here.

18:58.143 --> 19:00.771
They're both losers. Deal with it.

19:00.946 --> 19:04.438
Now get your ass up
and go with your father!

19:06.385 --> 19:08.353
I'm driving.

19:08.520 --> 19:09.680
I call shotgun.

19:09.855 --> 19:13.586
- Shotgun? What are you, a child?
- Me a child? You just bit me.

19:14.960 --> 19:17.588
Hey, don't rev it. You're wasting gas.

19:17.763 --> 19:20.254
- Hey. Hey, come back here.
- Hey.

19:20.432 --> 19:23.959
Is he waving
or did he just give us the finger?

19:24.236 --> 19:28.673
Both hands on the wheel, 10 and 2!

19:38.350 --> 19:41.046
Okay. Okay, that completes...

19:41.219 --> 19:45.087
...the "how to disagree
in a loving way" section.

19:45.257 --> 19:47.748
I think we did very well.

19:48.927 --> 19:52.158
I disagree but in a loving way.

19:55.133 --> 19:57.294
Okay, okay, next. Um...

19:57.469 --> 20:00.131
- Things we have in common.
- Oh, oh, oh.

20:00.305 --> 20:01.966
Charlie.

20:02.140 --> 20:05.576
- Same last name, same last name.
- Oh, very nice. Very nice.

20:06.945 --> 20:09.277
- Drink?
- Yes, I am.

20:16.455 --> 20:20.516
Okay. Things we have in common.
Things we have in common. Uh...

20:20.692 --> 20:22.353
Mom. We both have the same mother.

20:22.527 --> 20:25.018
No, no, no. You're adopted.

20:25.197 --> 20:26.255
Oh.

20:26.431 --> 20:28.592
Right, right, right.

20:28.767 --> 20:32.533
Okay, let's see. Let's see.
What do we have in common? Uh...

20:32.704 --> 20:34.695
Oh, oh. Oh, here's one.

20:34.873 --> 20:39.810
Um, we both feel unworthy of love
and battle homosexual panic.

20:47.219 --> 20:49.016
Maybe that's just me.

20:50.789 --> 20:52.450
- Maybe.
- Mm.

20:52.858 --> 20:54.883
Okay, okay. Here's one, here's one.

20:55.060 --> 20:56.960
We both love Jake.

20:57.129 --> 20:59.063
- Oh, Jake.
- Mm.

20:59.231 --> 21:01.324
Yeah, I love him.

21:01.500 --> 21:04.367
Where is the little fartmeister?

21:04.669 --> 21:06.466
I think he's sleeping.

21:06.638 --> 21:10.130
- Oh, he needs to know we love him.
- You're right.

21:10.308 --> 21:12.401
You're right. We don't tell him enough.

21:12.577 --> 21:16.343
Come on, let's go wake him up
and tell him we love him.

21:16.515 --> 21:18.949
Mm, good idea, good idea.

21:20.385 --> 21:22.717
Jake!

21:24.022 --> 21:26.889
Guess who loves you!
